# Xilinx ISE 14.7 / XST synthesis script
# Part: Spartan-3 XC3S400, package PQ208, speed grade -4
# 4-MAC hidden layer with registered 1-MAC pipelined output; 16.5 ns timing experiment.
run
-ifn parallel_4mac_pipe.prj
-ifmt VHDL
-ofn parallel_4mac_pipe
-ofmt NGC
-p xc3s400-4-pq208
-top nn_accelerator_4x8x1_synth_top
